ipt, a simple check will be incorporated to handle unlinked emission colors (`if not _n.inputs['Emission Color'].is_linked`) and apply a fix.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"edit_file","args":{"Path":"d:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\pipeline\\v5_anim.py","Replacement":"                if _n.type == 'BSDF_PRINCIPLED' and 'Emission Strength' in _n.inputs:\n                    if not _n.inputs['Emission Color'].is_linked:\n                        _n.inputs['Emission Color'].default_value = (1.0, 0.16, 0.018, 1.0)\n                    brake_disc_emit_inputs.append((\"disc_bsdf\", _n.inputs['Emission Strength'], None))\n                    break","Target":"                if _n.type == 'BSDF_PRINCIPLED' and 'Emission Strength' in _n.inputs:\n                    _n.inputs['Emission Color'].default_value = (1.0, 0.16, 0.018, 1.0)\n                    brake_disc_emit_inputs.append((\"disc_bsdf\", _n.inputs['Emission Strength'], None))\n                    break"}},{"name":"edit_file","args":{"Path":"d:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\pipeline\\v5_viewport_fast.py","Replacement":"    \"V5_Pit\", \"V5_Barrier\", \"V5_FencePosts\", \"V5_DRS\",\n    \"V5_Apex\", \"V5_Bollard\", \"V5_Sausage\", \"EM_\",","Target":"    \"V5_Pit\", \"V5_Barrier\", \"V5_FencePosts\", \"V5_DRS\",\n    \"V5_Bollard\", \"V5_Sausage\", \"EM_\","}}]}
